WEBVTT

00:08:58.787 --> 00:09:01.037
as police and dogs attacked us

00:09:02.704 --> 00:09:04.496
and we'd sing gospel songs.

00:09:06.912 --> 00:09:08.162
Those songs,

00:09:09.329 --> 00:09:12.746
that art inspired these people

00:09:13.704 --> 00:09:15.454
and it helped them make it through.

00:09:16.621 --> 00:09:19.329
Activism is how we change the world.

00:09:20.287 --> 00:09:22.746
And there are different ways
to engage in activism.

00:09:22.787 --> 00:09:25.037
And for me, that way is art.

00:09:29.121 --> 00:09:30.704
So I came back to the States